# Converted from the old Grade 2 Survex data (Grade2/Grade2/AC2.svx).

# > Ogof Draenen: Side passages off Squirrel Rift
# 
# This data represents a fairly rough compass & tape survey with
# occasional estimated clino readings.
# 
# Survey conducted on Saturday 19th November, by Andy Cave, Alex Gee
# and Ros Bateman
# Data entry: Tim Long

survey ac2

# Station Equivalences

# Specify units of measurement

# Magnetic North to Grid North correction
# Mag deviation at the time of the readings (9-Oct-94) was
# 4.2 degrees (data from OS sheet 161, 1991).

# Data ordering

centreline
  # BCRA2
  sd length 0.5 metres
  sd compass clino 2.5 degrees
  calibrate compass 4.2
  data normal from to length compass clino
  0	1	6.6	146	+15	# rift
  1	2	7.6	144	0	# hole on left
  2	3	2.0	0	+90	# climb in rift
  3	4	1.6	114	0
  4	5	3.0	150	0
  5	6	1.9	196	0
  6	7	5.9	135	0	# walking 'calcite corner' junc

  7a	7	6.7	166	0	# 3.5m wide digs in both directions

  7b1	7b2	4.1	316	0	# tube ends at fork - 2 digs
  7b2	7b3	2.9	23	0
  7b3	7b4	3.4	276	0	# hole on right to small dig
  7b4	7	3.8	350	0

  7	8	5.2	223	0	# rift
  8	9	7.0	189	0	# narrow walking
  9	10	4.3	218	0	# digs left and right

  10a	10	4.4	30	0
  10	11	6.4	175	0
  11	12	2.6	0	-90	# rift continues down to choke
  12	13	2.9	184	0
  13	14	6.3	192	0	# tube
  14	15	2.1	176	0
  15	16	4.6	0	+90	# rift climb
  16	17	1.4	30	0

endcentreline
endsurvey
